00:00:28.149 --> 00:00:29.066
(kissing noises)

00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:33.791
- It has hair on it.

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:35.045
- What is that, that's slimy? (laughs)

00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:36.391
- Man, I really--

00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:37.354
- It's a normal thing.

00:00:37.354 --> 00:00:38.213
- It's a normal thing?

00:00:38.213 --> 00:00:39.990
- It's a normal thing.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.406
