00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:53.044
- Wow, really good Kathy.

00:00:53.044 --> 00:00:54.111
Have you kissed a Barbie doll before?

00:00:54.111 --> 00:00:54.994
- Yeah, many.

00:00:54.994 --> 00:00:56.851
- I have to kiss it?

00:00:56.851 --> 00:00:58.151
- Yeah.

00:00:58.151 --> 00:00:59.069
