00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:44.191
- Shawn, Shawn, close your eyes.

00:01:44.191 --> 00:01:45.701
- I'm sorry, I opened my eyes.

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:47.036
But I knew it was a toy.

00:01:47.036 --> 00:01:48.057
I knew it was a toy

00:01:48.057 --> 00:01:48.997
- This game involves trust.

00:01:48.997 --> 00:01:49.879
- I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:01:49.879 --> 00:01:50.878
- (mumbles) trust.

00:01:50.878 --> 00:01:51.714
- I'm sorry.

00:01:51.714 --> 00:01:52.654
